+  // msbbol: Favorite Plus lists are stored per Lampac account and shared by all profiles.js profiles,
+  // so several devices/people may edit them. The original exported the whole local file and imported
+  // only at app start: a device opened earlier overwrote other devices' changes. Here every export is a
+  // three-way merge: base (last server state this device saw) -> local changes are applied on top of the
